ECHO MONEY

MASTER SYSTEM ENHANCEMENT, FINANCIAL LEDGER, ACCOUNTING ENGINE AND RELIABILITY SPECIFICATION

1. MISSION AND NON-NEGOTIABLE OBJECTIVE

Transform ECHO MONEY into a reliable, intelligent, offline-first personal financial ledger and mobile-money audit system.

The system must automatically capture, interpret, validate, categorize, reconcile and report financial activity from Airtel Money Zambia, MTN Mobile Money Zambia and other supported financial accounts.

It must provide a complete, understandable and traceable picture of the user's financial activity.

This is not simply an SMS reader, expense tracker or dashboard.

It is a personal accounting system with an automated transaction ingestion engine, double-entry financial journal, account reconciliation engine, transaction relationship engine and financial reporting system.

The system must prioritize:

1. Financial accuracy.
2. Data integrity.
3. Complete transaction traceability.
4. Duplicate prevention.
5. Correct accounting treatment.
6. Reliable balance calculations.
7. Recovery from errors and interruptions.
8. User privacy and data security.
9. Understandable financial reporting.
10. Maintainable and testable software architecture.

Never sacrifice accounting correctness for visual appearance or automation convenience.

